    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43366" root="لقم" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُقْمَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A morsel, gobbet,</i> or <i>mouthful: what is</i>
[<i>swallowed,</i> or] <i>eaten quickly, at once,</i> of bread
[&amp;c.]; like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرْعَةٌ</span> signifies what is swallowed
at once in drinking: (Msb:) or <i>what is prepared to be</i> [<i>swallowed,</i> or] <i>eaten quickly</i> [<i>at
once</i>]. (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُقْمَةٌ القَاضِى</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُقْمَةُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الخَلِيفَةِ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُمَاوَرْدٌ</span>, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ورد</span>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُيَسَّرٌ</span>.

